WEBVTT

00:00:56.928 --> 00:01:00.890
was actually prompted
by having a chronic illness.

00:01:01.808 --> 00:01:02.975
I know.

00:01:03.601 --> 00:01:05.311
And in the Philippines,

00:01:05.311 --> 00:01:10.024
having a chronic disease can be a reason
for employment discrimination,

00:01:10.066 --> 00:01:12.068
which I experienced firsthand.

00:01:12.568 --> 00:01:15.613
And since nobody decided to employ me,

00:01:15.655 --> 00:01:17.406
I decided to employ myself,

00:01:17.448 --> 00:01:19.325
and started my company instead,

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:22.495
to contribute in building
the future of work

00:01:22.537 --> 00:01:24.288
that leaves no one behind.

00:01:24.914 --> 00:01:26.124
Little did I know --

00:01:26.165 --> 00:01:27.375
(Applause)

00:01:27.416 --> 00:01:28.918
that starting this company --

00:01:28.918 --> 00:01:30.086
thank you --